626
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:43,000
Oh, of course, of course.

627
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:46,000
And within the social order.

628
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:51,000
And I had to think about my own growing up

629
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:59,000
