632
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:08,000
But that set up a conflict in me.

633
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:09,000
Of course.

634
00:35:09,000 --> 00:35:14,000
Because I couldn't understand

635
00:35:14,000 --> 00:35:17,000
