669
00:36:55,000 --> 00:37:01,000
And I was just still.

670
00:37:01,000 --> 00:37:02,000
Quite.

671
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:04,000
Just still.

672
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:08,000
I think that's something of what you mean

673
00:37:08,000 --> 00:37:12,000
